    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^663300Lowen, of the 2nd squad, returned to her detachment 3 days after the incident. A trial was held, and she was judged guilty of fleeing when ordered to fight.^000000",
      "translation" : "^663300第二小队的洛文在事件发生3天后回到了所属分队。她接受了审判，并被判定在奉命作战时临阵脱逃。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Personnel Record]",
      "translation" : "[人事档案]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^663300Despite the severity of this offense, she was only discharged from the Crusaders and the holy power granted to her was forcibly removed...^000000",
      "translation" : "^663300尽管罪行严重，她却只被十字军除名，身上被授予的神圣力量也遭到强行剥夺...^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She was forced to leave the Crusaders?! That's ridiculous!",
      "translation" : "她竟然被迫离开十字军？！太荒唐了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Did they want to sentence her to death or what? That's almost too cruel. She must have been humiliated...",
      "translation" : "他们是想判她死刑吗？这也太残酷了。她一定受尽了屈辱..."
